{"from": "passage:lk-12-36", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-25-06", "note": "Same wedding-watchfulness teaching, but the checkable facts differ: Luke's servants watch for their lord returning FROM the marriage feast and open when he knocks; Matthew 25:6 has the bridegroom arrive at midnight and the wedding party go out to meet him in procession. Reviewer 6: the asserts edge to claim:mt-25-06-bridegroom-at-night was removed for that difference."}
